      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Curated by Melanie Monique Rose\n\nNisto is the Cree word for \"three\", which holds abundant cultural, religious, and spiritual significance throughout Treaty Territories 4 and 6, Abya Yala 1, and across the world. The braid, made of three strands,  [...]"
