    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "These series of works are an excerpt from a previous exhibition 'TADHANA'. These works explore the views as newcomer’s common concept that \"fate brought us here\" and the most common Filipino outlook of \"bahala na\" / \"come what may\" attitude w [...]"
