        "@value": "The exhibition Wóknaga1, Nakoda for \"He Tells His Own Story\"2, features paintings by Métis, Nêhiyawak/Nakoda/Anishinaabe/Scottish artist, Dave Pelletier, of môso-tâpiskan3, now known as Moose Jaw. Working within a Woodland School style, Pellet [...]"
